          "request": {
            "name": "Tenant Secret Rotation Begin",
            "description": {
              "content": "Begin rotation for a tenant secret. If `id` is specified, the assignment with that ID will be marked InRotation. If `secretType` and `secretPath` are specified, the tenant's Current secret matching those will be marked InRotation.\nInRotation secrets can still be used for decryption.",
